"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&杨欣\n抓了你们这些蜀将我就可以升官啦！\n&张嶷\n不可能。\n&杨欣\n为什么？\n&张嶷\n因为你长得太丑了。\n&杨欣\n长得丑关能不能升官什么事？\n&张嶷\n有关系，试问见到阁下如此尊容，谁还能\n冷静品评你的表现？\n&杨欣\n长得丑也有错？！\n&张嶷\n当然有。看你资质还不错，回去整个容再\n来吧。\n&杨欣\n喔…"]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,151,0,0,0,0,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&张嶷\n这样也行？看来贼军笨蛋将领还真不少。"]},{"op":61,"name":"get_item","args":[99,0,1,22]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[41,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":11,"offset":19567,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":38,"name":"test_unit_in_area","args":[0,16,36,18,38]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[12],[30]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":81,"name":"op_51","args":[]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&姜维\n现在没有时间休息了，赶快进军桥头，\n准备援救阳安关。"]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":65,"name":"test_units_in_area","args":[2,11,1,0,0,0,0,0]},"end":6},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["达成印绶条件\n将敌军数量减少到十人以下。"]},{"op":61,"name":"get_item","args":[97,0,1,0]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,0,0,0,23,39,4]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,1,0,0,23,39,4]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,2,0,0,23,39,4]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,4,0,0,23,39,4]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,5,0,0,23,39,4]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,18,0,0,23,39,4]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,11,0,0,23,39,4]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,10,0,0,23,39,4]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,8,0,0,23,39,4]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,9,0,0,23,39,4]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,22,0,0,23,39,4]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵广\n呵呵呵…既然大将军已经撤退，我也可以\n安心上路了。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[40]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,645,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,105,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,106,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&邓忠\n爹，居然还有一个蜀将留在这里。\n&师纂\n一个人居然能制造我军如此的伤亡，他是\n怪物吗？\n&邓艾1\n姜维把这样的人才留在这里牺牲，他也真\n够残酷的。\n&邓艾1\n不过这绝对是正确的决定，如果换做是我\n也会这样做的。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[19,65535,0,0,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵广\n呼…呼…敌将是何人，报上名来！\n&邓艾1\n义阳邓士载。\n&邓忠\n爹，让我去解决他。\n&邓艾1\n不用了，这个人就交给我军吧。\n&邓忠\n可是面对这样的武人，不是应该要亲自\n动手解决他才是表示尊敬？\n&邓艾1\n我为什么要为了尊敬敌人让自己冒生命\n危险？\n&邓艾1\n忠儿，打仗靠的不是浪漫思想，而是靠\n兵法和谋略。\n&邓艾1\n只要能够毁掉敌人，保全自己就算是胜\n利。\n&师纂\n（这家伙真是让人讨厌，但却无法反驳他\n的话。）"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,282,0,13,8,2]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,283,0,14,8,2]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,284,0,15,8,2]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,285,0,10,10,1]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,286,0,10,11,1]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,287,0,10,12,1]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,288,0,18,10,3]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,289,0,18,11,3]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,290,0,18,12,3]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,291,0,13,15,0]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,292,0,14,15,0]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,293,0,15,15,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[2]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[282,6,0,0]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[283,6,0,0]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[284,6,0,0]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[285,6,0,0]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[286,6,0,0]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[287,6,0,0]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[288,6,0,0]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[289,6,0,0]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[290,6,0,0]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[290,6,0,0]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[292,6,0,0]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[293,6,0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[19,3,0,0]},{"op":35,"name":"play_music","args":[35,1]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[19,9,0,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵广\n爹，我马上就去见您了，希望您不要责怪\n我为什么这么快过来，孩儿实在已经尽力\n了。\n&赵广\n大哥，我和爹会在那里保佑你的。"]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[19,4,0,0]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[30,1]},{"op":89,"name":"op_59","args":[1200,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535]},{"op":73,"name":"ui_49","args":[]},{"op":13,"name":"next_scene","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":12,"offset":21864,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":46,"name":"test_adjacent","args":[19,149,1]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[12],[44]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[19,149,65535,65535,1,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[149,19,65535,65535,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&王颀\n你难道不要命了？\n&赵广\n不要命又如何？难得上天赐予这样宝贵\n的机会让我展现我的价值，我为什么要\n放掉？\n&王颀\n（蜀人难道都是一群傻瓜？）"]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[44,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":13,"offset":22120,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[2,7,0,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[224]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&杨兰\n真是不小心，我的爱情之路总是这么\n坎坷。"]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,2,0,0,0,0,0]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[224,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":14,"offset":22265,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[19,7,0,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[153]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵广\n为什么在这时候就倒下了？我赵广真的这\n么没用？"]},{"op":83,"name":"unit_op_53","args":[0,19,0,0,0,0,6,1]},{"op":73,"name":"ui_49","args":[]},{"op":14,"name":"ui_0e","args":[]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[153,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":15,"offset":22424,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op"